<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Turbina Soluções — Soluções digitais para o seu negócio</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Gestão simplificada para personal trainers, barbearias, academias e muito mais. Conheça os produtos Turbina.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* ============================================
       DESIGN SYSTEM — Turbina Soluções
       ============================================ */
    :root {
      /* Background */
      --bg: #0D1117;
      --surface: #151B23;
      --surface-2: #1C2330;

      /* Borders */
      --border: #2A3441;
      --border-subtle: #1E2A36;
      --border-active: #3A4A5A;

      /* Text */
      --text: #E8EDF3;
      --text-secondary: #8B95A1;
      --text-muted: #5A6474;

      /* Accents per product */
      --fit: #22C55E;
      --fit-hover: #16A34A;
      --fit-bg: rgba(34,197,94,0.08);

      --barber: #8B5E34;
      --barber-hover: #A06B3A;
      --barber-bg: rgba(139,94,52,0.08);

      --academia: #22C55E;
      --academia-hover: #16A34A;
      --academia-bg: rgba(34,197,94,0.08);

      --mercado: #6366F1;
      --mercado-hover: #4F46E5;
      --mercado-bg: rgba(99,102,241,0.08);

      /* Spacing */
      --space-xs: 0.25rem;
      --space-sm: 0.5rem;
      --space-md: 1rem;
      --space-lg: 1.5rem;
      --space-xl: 2rem;
      --space-2xl: 3rem;
      --space-3xl: 4rem;
      --space-4xl: 6rem;

      /* Radius */
      --radius-sm: 6px;
      --radius-md: 10px;
      --radius-lg: 16px;

      /* Font */
      --font: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    /* ============================================
       RESET & BASE
       ============================================ */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

    /* Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 4px; }

    /* ============================================
       LAYOUT
       ============================================ */
    .container {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 var(--space-xl);
    }

    /* ============================================
       NAVBAR
       ============================================ */
    .navbar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: var(--space-md) 0;
      transition: background 0.3s, backdrop-filter 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .navbar.scrolled {
      background: rgba(13,17,23,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-bottom-color: var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .navbar .container {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .navbar-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .navbar-logo {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      background: var(--fit);
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .navbar-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
      list-style: none;
    }

    .navbar-links a {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      transition: color 0.2s;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .navbar-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-family: var(--font);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      border: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--fit);
      color: var(--bg);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--fit-hover); }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--border-active); background: var(--surface); }

    .btn-lg {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    }

    /* ============================================
       HERO
       ============================================ */
    .hero {
      padding-top: 10rem;
      padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .hero-badge .dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--fit);
      animation: pulse-dot 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse-dot {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; }
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .hero h1 .highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--fit), #34D399);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-2xl);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* ============================================
       PRODUCTS
       ============================================ */
    .products {
      padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    }

    .section-desc {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 1rem;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
    }

    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .product-card {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: var(--space-2xl);
      transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .product-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--card-accent, var(--border));
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.25s;
    }

    .product-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--card-accent, var(--border-active));
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .product-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

    .product-card--fit { --card-accent: var(--fit); }
    .product-card--barber { --card-accent: var(--barber); }
    .product-card--academia { --card-accent: var(--academia); }
    .product-card--mercado { --card-accent: var(--mercado); }

    .product-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
      background: var(--card-bg, var(--surface-2));
    }

    .product-card--fit .product-icon { background: var(--fit-bg); }
    .product-card--barber .product-icon { background: var(--barber-bg); }
    .product-card--academia .product-icon { background: var(--academia-bg); }
    .product-card--mercado .product-icon { background: var(--mercado-bg); }

    .product-name {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .product-desc {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
      flex: 1;
    }

    .product-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .product-status {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
    }

    .status-live {
      background: rgba(34,197,94,0.12);
      color: var(--fit);
    }

    .status-soon {
      background: rgba(139,149,161,0.1);
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .status-dev {
      background: var(--mercado-bg);
      color: var(--mercado);
    }

    .product-link {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--card-accent, var(--text-secondary));
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      transition: gap 0.2s;
    }

    .product-card:hover .product-link { gap: 0.55rem; }

    .product-link-arrow { transition: transform 0.2s; }
    .product-card:hover .product-link-arrow { transform: translateX(2px); }

    .product-link-disabled {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* ============================================
       WHY TURBINA
       ============================================ */
    .why {
      padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .why-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-2xl);
      margin-top: var(--space-3xl);
    }

    .why-item h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    }

    .why-item p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ============================================
       CTA
       ============================================ */
    .cta {
      padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    }

    .cta-box {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: var(--space-4xl) var(--space-2xl);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .cta-box::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 200px;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--fit), transparent);
    }

    .cta-box h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }

    .cta-box p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
      max-width: 400px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .cta-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* ============================================
       FOOTER
       ============================================ */
    .footer {
      padding: var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .footer-content {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .footer-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .footer-brand .navbar-logo {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
      list-style: none;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--text-secondary); }

    .footer-copy {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: var(--space-xl);
      padding-top: var(--space-lg);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    /* ============================================
       ANIMATIONS
       ============================================ */
    .fade-up {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
      transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
    }

    .fade-up.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .fade-up { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
      .hero-badge .dot { animation: none; }
    }

    /* ============================================
       RESPONSIVE
       ============================================ */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .navbar-links { display: none; }

      .hero { padding-top: 8rem; }

      .products-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .why-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-xl);
      }

      .footer-content {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer-links { justify-content: center; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1rem; }
      .btn-lg { padding: 0.65rem 1.4rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
      .product-card { padding: var(--space-xl); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- NAVBAR -->
  <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="#" class="navbar-brand">
        <div class="navbar-logo">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/>
            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/>
            <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        Turbina Soluções
      </a>
      <ul class="navbar-links">
        <li><a href="#produtos">Produtos</a></li>
        <li><a href="#por-que">Por que a Turbina</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contato">Contato</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contato" class="btn btn-primary">Fale conosco</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-badge fade-up">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        Plataforma em crescimento
      </div>
      <h1 class="fade-up">Gestão simples.<br><span class="highlight">Resultados reais.</span></h1>
      <p class="fade-up">Soluções digitais feitas para quem trabalha com serviços — personal trainers, barbearias, academias e muito mais.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions fade-up">
        <a href="#produtos" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Conheça nossos produtos</a>
        <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Fale conosco</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRODUCTS -->
  <section class="products" id="produtos">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label fade-up">Produtos</p>
      <h2 class="section-title fade-up">Feito para o seu nicho</h2>
      <p class="section-desc fade-up">Cada produto da Turbina foi pensado para resolver problemas reais de um segmento específico.</p>

      <div class="products-grid">

        <!-- Turbina Fit -->
        <a href="https://turbinafit.turbinasolucoes.com.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="product-card product-card--fit fade-up">
          <div class="product-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--fit)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M6.5 6.5h11"/><path d="M6.5 17.5h11"/><path d="M3 6.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 3.5-3.5"/><path d="M3 17.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 3.5 3.5"/><path d="M21 6.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.5-3.5"/><path d="M21 17.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-3.5 3.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="product-name">Turbina Fit</h3>
          <p class="product-desc">Gestão completa para personal trainers. Agendamento, pagamentos, treinos e comunicação com alunos em um só lugar.</p>
          <div class="product-footer">
            <span class="product-status status-live">Disponível</span>
            <span class="product-link">Acessar <span class="product-link-arrow">→</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Turbina Barber -->
        <a href="https://turbinabarber.turbinasolucoes.com.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="product-card product-card--barber fade-up">
          <div class="product-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--barber)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M6 3v18"/><path d="M18 3v18"/><path d="M6 8h12"/><path d="M6 16h12"/><path d="M6 3c0 0 0 5 0 5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="product-name">Turbina Barber</h3>
          <p class="product-desc">Sistema de gestão para barbearias. Controle de agenda, fila de espera, caixa e fidelidade de clientes.</p>
          <div class="product-footer">
            <span class="product-status status-live">Disponível</span>
            <span class="product-link">Acessar <span class="product-link-arrow">→</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Turbina Academia -->
        <div class="product-card product-card--academia fade-up">
          <div class="product-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--academia)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="15" rx="2"/><path d="M17 2l-5 5-5-5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="product-name">Turbina Academia</h3>
          <p class="product-desc">Gestão completa para academias e fitness. Planos, matrículas, acesso e relatórios — tudo integrado.</p>
          <div class="product-footer">
            <span class="product-status status-soon">Em breve</span>
            <span class="product-link product-link-disabled">Em breve</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Turbina Mercado -->
        <div class="product-card product-card--mercado fade-up">
          <div class="product-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--mercado)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="product-name">Turbina Mercado</h3>
          <p class="product-desc">Marketplace para produtos e serviços. Catálogo, pedidos, entregas e gestão de vendedores.</p>
          <div class="product-footer">
            <span class="product-status status-dev">Em desenvolvimento</span>
            <span class="product-link product-link-disabled">Em breve</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY TURBINA -->
  <section class="why" id="por-que">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label fade-up">Por que a Turbina</p>
      <h2 class="section-title fade-up">Feito por quem entende do assunto</h2>

      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-item fade-up">
          <h3>Gestão simplificada</h3>
          <p>Interface limpa e direta. Sem funcionalidades desnecessárias — só o que você precisa pra rodar o negócio no piloto automático.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item fade-up">
          <h3>Feito para o seu nicho</h3>
          <p>Cada produto é construído pensando nas necessidades reais de um segmento. Não é solução genérica — é ferramenta profissional.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item fade-up">
          <h3>Suporte humano</h3>
          <p>Quando você precisa de ajuda, fala com gente que entende o sistema. Sem robôs, sem filas infinitas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta" id="contato">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box fade-up">
        <h2>Pronto para turbinar?</h2>
        <p>Fale com a gente e descubra como a Turbina pode simplificar a gestão do seu negócio.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="https://wa.me/5500000000000" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Falar no WhatsApp</a>
          <a href="mailto:contato@turbinasolucoes.com.br" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Enviar e-mail</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-content">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <div class="navbar-logo">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/>
              <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/>
              <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          Turbina Soluções
        </div>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="#produtos">Produtos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#por-que">Sobre</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contato">Contato</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 Turbina Soluções. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- SCRIPTS -->
  <script>
    // Navbar scroll effect
    const navbar = document.getElementById('navbar');
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      navbar.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 20);
    }, { passive: true });

    // Fade-up on scroll
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add('visible');
          observer.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });

    document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
  </script>

</body>
</html>
